      "vipSummary": {
        "id": 1448637564,
        "html": "<p>ADRB2 encodes the beta-2-adrenergic receptor (beta2-AR), a G-protein-coupled adrenergic receptor that plays important roles in the regulation of the cardiac, pulmonary, vascular, endocrine and central nervous systems. Beta2-AR is the target of clinically important drugs for asthma and cardiovascular conditions including hypertension and congestive heart failure.</p>\n",
